318
00:43:20.177 --> 00:43:21.577
Hold...hold on a second.

319
00:43:21.882 --> 00:43:23.057
Listen to me.

320
00:43:23.585 --> 00:43:25.204
You got to go real slow
in explaining what's happening

321
00:43:25.315 --> 00:43:27.612
-'cause I'm really
fuckin' stoned right now.

322
00:43:27.898 --> 00:43:29.804
OK...Um...

323
00:43:30.221 --> 00:43:32.231
There's people out there...

324
00:43:32.929 --> 00:43:34.036
