325
00:43:34.528 --> 00:43:36.277
There's people out there...!

326
00:43:36.543 --> 00:43:38.186
and they killed David and Wayne.

327
00:43:38.235 --> 00:43:41.009
Some kind of cult.
Do you have a cell phone?

328
00:43:41.349 --> 00:43:42.956
- [quietly] Where's your cell phone?

329
00:43:43.076 --> 00:43:45.625
-<i> [impatient] Where is your cell phone?</i>
- Just relax!

330
00:43:45.751 --> 00:43:47.197
[Whispers] They're out there!

331
00:43:54.347 --> 00:43:55.501
Scott?

332
00:44:01.998 --> 00:44:03.251
The lights are on the motion sensors.

333
00:44:03.278 --> 00:44:05.099
They'll come on
if anyone near the house.

334
00:44:05.217 --> 00:44:06.664
Take a seat for a second.

335
00:44:06.737 --> 00:44:08.777
Take a seat for a second!
I'll be right back.

336
00:44:08.818 --> 00:44:10.427
Titus! Stay here!

337
00:44:10.661 --> 00:44:13.021
Phone's around here somewhere.
Let me find it.

338
00:45:24.237 --> 00:45:25.313
Scott?

339
00:45:33.398 --> 00:45:34.489
I'm right here.

340
00:45:34.541 --> 00:45:35.907
- Where's you cell phone?
- Shh! Shh!

341
00:45:35.983 --> 00:45:39.362
- Police'll never get here in time.
- Scott! <i>Where's your phone?</i>

342
00:45:46.650 --> 00:45:49.271
- They're here!
- Hey Titus! It's okay!

343
00:45:50.025 --> 00:45:53.231
- How many are out there?
- Four. Four at least.

344
00:45:57.846 --> 00:46:00.074
