347
00:46:24.195 --> 00:46:26.394
[Eerie summoning whistle]

348
00:46:40.144 --> 00:46:41.945
[Summoning whistle]

349
00:46:44.458 --> 00:46:46.605
- [Justine] Titus!
- [Scott] Titus no!

350
00:46:46.824 --> 00:46:48.297
Titus come here!

351
00:46:49.764 --> 00:46:50.708
Titus!

352
00:46:52.458 --> 00:46:54.217
[dog whimpers]

353
00:46:54.708 --> 00:46:55.507
<i>Titus!<i/>

354
00:46:56.157 --> 00:46:57.358
[Dog in agony]

355
00:46:57.523 --> 00:47:00.554
Get off my dog you fucking pieces of shit!

356
00:47:01.804 --> 00:47:04.103
A piercing yelp then silence

357
00:47:05.248 --> 00:47:06.996
Where the fuck are you?

358
00:47:22.063 --> 00:47:24.065
They killed my dog.
They got my baby.

359
00:47:24.186 --> 00:47:26.331
- Pieces of shit!
- [Justine] We have to go!

360
00:47:26.451 --> 00:47:27.411
Right now!

361
00:47:27.606 --> 00:47:30.099
- Get the keys! They're on the table!
- Where?

362
00:47:34.632 --> 00:47:35.771
Where's the phone!

363
00:47:35.820 --> 00:47:37.626
I don't know! I don't know!
Check the desk!

364
00:47:41.427 --> 00:47:42.400
Oh God!

365
00:47:42.744 --> 00:47:44.753
God where the fuck is it!?

366
00:47:46.811 --> 00:47:48.260
Have to call 91.....

367
00:47:48.983 --> 00:47:51.201
I got you, you son of a bitch!

368
00:47:57.384 --> 00:47:58.262
Scott?

369
00:47:59.603 --> 00:48:00.849
Scott!

370
00:48:37.199 --> 00:48:38.682
[Scott cries out]

371
00:48:46.733 --> 00:48:48.543
[summoning whistle]

372
00:48:48.590 --> 00:48:50.572
[summoning whistle]
- Justine screams

373
00:49:04.369 --> 00:49:06.166
<i>911 Emergency Direct?</i>

374
00:49:06.259 --> 00:49:08.166
<i>Did someone just try
reaching us on this line?</i>

375
00:49:08.291 --> 00:49:10.813
My name is Justine Wills!
I'm at Birch College!

376
00:49:10.867 --> 00:49:13.657
There're people try to kill me!
They killed the guards. I need help.

377
00:49:13.710 --> 00:49:15.610
<i>You're gonna be ok.
Where are you right now?</i>

378
00:49:15.650 --> 00:49:17.177
I'm on campus.

379
00:49:17.498 --> 00:49:19.048
... the...the library.

380
00:49:19.275 --> 00:49:20.561
I'll be in the library.

381
00:49:20.681 --> 00:49:22.690
I have the keys.
I can lock myself inside.

382
00:49:22.773 --> 00:49:24.230
<i>I need you to stay on the line.</i>

383
00:49:24.336 --> 00:49:26.449
<i>Go now but keep your phone open.</i>

384
00:49:58.103 --> 00:49:59.159
Hello?

385
00:49:59.847 --> 00:50:01.192
I'm here.
I'm inside.

386
00:50:02.791 --> 00:50:04.298
<i>I need you to stay on the line.</i>

387
00:50:04.394 --> 00:50:05.907
<i>We have a unit close by.</i>

388
00:50:06.027 --> 00:50:07.423
<i>They'll be right with you.</i>

389
00:50:07.543 --> 00:50:08.670
Thank you.

390
00:50:12.130 --> 00:50:13.416
Oh God thank you!

391
00:50:13.719 --> 00:50:15.119
<i>You're welcome...</i>

392
00:50:17.181 --> 00:50:18.030
<i>...Kristy.</i>

393
00:50:19.048 --> 00:50:22.661
<i> [Violet taunting] Kristy, Kristy, Kris-tee!</i>

394
00:50:22.956 --> 00:50:27.018
<i>Don't you realize that the maintenance
man's number is posted all over this campus?</i>

395
00:54:17.043 --> 00:54:18.547
Smile Kristy.

396
00:54:19.047 --> 00:54:20.940
I'm not Kristy!

397
00:54:22.057 --> 00:54:23.744
Why are you doing this?

398
00:54:23.864 --> 00:54:25.139
Pretty hair.

399
00:54:25.721 --> 00:54:27.030
Pretty car.

400
00:55:27.092 --> 00:55:28.963
<i>[Violet's echoing whisper] Kristy! Kristy!</i>

401
00:55:29.840 --> 00:55:30.855
<i>Kristy!</i>

402
00:55:34.340 --> 00:55:39.547
<i>Kristy! Kristy, Kristy, Kristy...<b>Kristy!</b></i>

403
00:55:53.659 --> 00:55:54.938
Oh my God!

404
00:55:59.172 --> 00:56:00.054
Aaron.

405
00:56:00.197 --> 00:56:01.132
Aaron.

406
00:56:01.927 --> 00:56:02.851
Aaron!

407
00:56:03.550 --> 00:56:04.610
[Calls] Aaron!

408
00:56:05.121 --> 00:56:06.231
[Screams] Aaron!

409
00:56:14.269 --> 00:56:15.608
What the hell?

410
00:56:19.148 --> 00:56:20.851
Justine!

411
00:56:24.425 --> 00:56:25.777
Jus!

412
00:56:28.701 --> 00:56:29.697
Jus!

413
00:56:32.268 --> 00:56:33.496
You okay?

414
00:56:34.697 --> 00:56:35.771
Aaron!

415
00:56:36.271 --> 00:56:37.331
Aaron!

416
00:56:38.202 --> 00:56:39.157
Justine?

417
00:56:40.085 --> 00:56:41.130
Aaron!

418
00:56:42.788 --> 00:56:43.487
Hey!

419
00:56:43.699 --> 00:56:44.858
Who are you?

420
00:56:47.960 --> 00:56:48.847
Aaron!

421
00:56:48.987 --> 00:56:49.893
Aaron!

422
00:56:50.070 --> 00:56:51.070
Come here!

423
00:56:51.190 --> 00:56:53.041
Come here! We have to go!
We have to go!

424
00:56:53.161 --> 00:56:54.567
Come here! <i>Now!</i>

425
00:56:54.679 --> 00:56:56.039
We have to <i>go</i>!

426
00:56:56.184 --> 00:56:58.481
- Come on!
- Justine what the hell is goin' on?

427
00:56:58.527 --> 00:56:59.514
We don't have time...

428
00:56:59.574 --> 00:57:01.182
Are you okay?
What the hell...

429
00:57:02.668 --> 00:57:03.668
<i> [Anguished] No!</i>

430
00:57:04.342 --> 00:57:05.588
<i>No!</i>

431
00:57:05.987 --> 00:57:07.190
<i> [plaintive] No!</i>

432
00:57:07.472 --> 00:57:08.644
<i>[embittered] No!</i>

433
00:57:23.353 --> 00:57:25.155
<i>[resolute] No!</i>

434
00:58:01.213 --> 00:58:02.432
Fuck you!

435
00:58:06.311 --> 00:58:08.556
Fucking die you piece of shit!

436
00:58:28.923 --> 00:58:29.998
[engine stalls] Come on.

437
00:59:55.170 --> 00:59:56.434
<i>Aaron come on.</i>

438
00:59:57.567 --> 00:59:58.610
<i> I love you.</i>

439
01:00:00.634 --> 01:00:02.023
<i>I love you Justine.</i>

440
01:00:50.422 --> 01:00:52.032
[whispers] You can do this!

441
01:13:06.998 --> 01:13:09.338
<i>Kill Kristy!</i>

442
01:13:10.427 --> 01:13:12.038
<i>Kristy is pretty,</i>

443
01:13:12.175 --> 01:13:13.212
<i>pure...</i>

444
01:13:13.500 --> 01:13:14.680
<i>...blessed.</i>

445
01:13:47.047 --> 01:13:48.203
No God,

446
01:13:48.711 --> 01:13:49.844
no law...

447
01:13:50.051 --> 01:13:52.118
