448
01:14:34.529 --> 01:14:37.677
<i> [echo] Kristy!</i>

449
01:14:41.563 --> 01:14:43.956
<i>Kristy!
Kristy!</i>

450
01:15:35.081 --> 01:15:36.831
[Calm] I wouldn't do that.

451
01:15:40.298 --> 01:15:41.587
