454
01:15:50.911 --> 01:15:52.194
You have nothing.

455
01:17:24.952 --> 01:17:26.707
<i>She was one of many.</i>

456
01:17:28.792 --> 01:17:30.365
<i>There are more out there.</i>

457
01:17:41.095 --> 01:17:45.704
<i>Information from the lone survivor of
