458
01:17:45.850 --> 01:17:48.440
<i>has lead authorities...
...Police in Colorado arrested three young men</i>

459
01:17:48.474 --> 01:17:50.774
<i>...and are looking for the fourth
in connection with a series of murders...</i>

460
01:17:50.827 --> 01:17:53.069
<i>...Now coming in from Portland, Oregon</i>

461
01:17:53.123 --> 01:17:55.516
<i>...four more...
- Multiple gangs in many states...</i>

462
01:17:55.601 --> 01:17:58.046
<i>...practicing a series of ritual killings</i>

463
01:17:58.123 --> 01:18:00.934
<i>...This cult apparently has multiple cells</i>

464
01:18:01.012 --> 01:18:03.833
<i>that may be responsible for the abduction and murder...</i>

465
01:18:03.873 --> 01:18:05.864
<i>...Police confirm she
had a cell phone...</i>

466
01:18:05.984 --> 01:18:09.887
<i>...containing vital intel on the methods
and whereabouts of [news reports fade]...</i>

467
01:18:19.418 --> 01:18:21.051
<i>Justine is dead.</i>

468
01:18:25.975 --> 01:18:28.775
<i>My name is Kristy.</i>

469
01:18:29.399 --> 01:18:34.576
